s by 4.0% on average."],"own":["Insiders own 16.3%, meaningful skin in the game, and institutions hold 94%.","Insiders have only bought over the past year (1 purchase).","It returns 3.7% a year to shareholders (1.7% in buybacks and 2.0% in dividends).","The share count has shrunk 0.9% a year over five years, steadily raising each holder's stake.","It has paid a dividend for 21 consecutive years, raising it 9.8% a year over the last five.","Short interest is elevated at 10.5% of the float, 7.1 days to cover."],"people":["With about 17,320 employees, each generates about $374K of revenue, in line with the Consumer Cyclical median, and productivity has risen 5.1% a year.","That works out to $24K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $2.7M (7x revenue per employee).","Stock compensation averages $1K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"INVEST","conv":72,"head":"Invest: trades 48% below fair value of $79.43; Piotroski F-score 8/9.","pros":["Model rating LEAN BUY (composite 50, gates 15/24)","Trades 48% below fair value of $79.43","Piotroski F-score 8/9","EV/EBITDA 8.8x vs sector 11.2x","P/FCF 10.3x vs sector 16.5x"],"cons":["Net debt/EBITDA 3.6x"],"flags":[],"need":[],"buy_below":67.51,"vc":{"base":79.43,"base_src":"dcf","bear":55.74,"bull":115.38,"alt_median":36.35,"n_alt":3,"gap":1.1854,"dispersion":0.3128,"level":"LOW","why":["models disagree (31% dispersion)","DCF is 119% above the other models' median ($36.35)"]},"med":{"pe":19.2575,"ev_ebitda":11.198,"pfcf":16.4664,"pb":2.375,"roic":0.1281,"gross_margin":0.3475,"fcf_margin":0.0624,"div_yield":0.0228}},"ticker":"SLGN","date":"2026-11-06"}